---
import SectionIntro from './SectionIntro.astro';
---
<section class="border-y border-graphite/80">
  <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-[1200px] gap-12 px-5 py-20 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.35fr] lg:px-6 lg:py-28">
    <SectionIntro eyebrow="WHY BECODER" title="竞赛工作流，有不同的优先级。" description="竞赛编程不该从拼装编辑器、编译器、语言服务和运行命令开始。" />
    <div class="grid gap-px overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-graphite bg-graphite sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="bg-carbon p-6 sm:p-7"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-ash">01</p><h3 class="mt-8 text-xl text-white">少做配置</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-mist">编译器与 C/C++ 代码智能，本就是产品环境的一部分。</p></div>
      <div class="bg-carbon p-6 sm:p-7"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-ash">02</p><h3 class="mt-8 text-xl text-white">一条直接链路</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-mist">编写、编译、阅读反馈、运行、重复，无需自行拼接工具。</p></div>
      <div class="bg-carbon p-6 sm:p-7"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-ash">03</p><h3 class="mt-8 text-xl text-white">默认可预期</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-mist">核心工具使用 BeCoder 自带资源，不依赖系统编译器配置。</p></div>
      <div class="bg-carbon p-6 sm:p-7"><p class="font-mono text-xs text-ash">04</p><h3 class="mt-8 text-xl text-white">专注于题目</h3><p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-6 text-mist">基于熟悉的编辑器基础，刻意收敛到 C/C++ 竞赛工作。</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
